	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The text below is about the account payable process. It begins when you send to the vendor accounting department. 
After sending to the vendor accounting department, you need to create a receiving report.
When creating a receiving report is completed, confirming all documents have been amended needs to be done. 
After confirming all documents have been amended, one or more of the following paths should be executed: creating voucher for the documents, stamping all documents. 
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The below text is about the account payable process. It starts when you send the vendor accounting department.
After you send the vendor accounting department, you must create a receiving report.
When creating a receipt report is completed, it needs to confirm that all documents have been amended.
After confirming that all documents have been amended, a or more of the following paths should be executed: creating a voucher for the documents, stamping all documents.
The process is now completed.
"
